cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: embedded_types
abstract: >-
    Fixed-width integer aliases, a boolean, a machine word derived from the
    target's pointer width, an index type, and an unaligned-access word for C11
    embedded work. Also a static assertion, feature probes, attribute wrappers,
    and compile-time assertions that pin a dispatch table's members to consecutive
    slots. Header only, nothing allocated, nothing run at startup.
type: software
